mpling Technique), which resulted in the equal distribution of both the classes (0 and 1). Used the following modules in Python-Pandas, NumPy, Scikit-Learn, matplotlib, Imbalanced-learn Logistic Regression gave AUC=0.95, but the precision was very low (0.08). So, I tried Random Forests and it gave AUC=0.94 and precision=0.85 (with 'gini' criterion) and AUC=0.92 & precision=0.83 (with 'entropy' criterion). Measured performance metrics-accuracy, precision, recall, AUC and plotted ROC curve Used the following modules in Python-Pandas, NumPy, Scikit-Learn, matplotlib, Imbalanced-learn","topics":[],"score":234964,"global_rank":95427,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":16547},{"name":"joelstanner/RealPython_book2","owner":"joelstanner","html_url":"https://github.com/joelstanner/RealPython_book2","stars":3,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Where python goes to GIT REAL","topics":[],"score":234955,"global_rank":95433,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":16548},{"name":"Soester10/HandJutsu","owner":"Soester10","html_url":"https://github.com/Soester10/HandJutsu","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"NYU-CSGY6953-DL-Project","topics":[],"score":234949,"global_rank":95446,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":16549},{"name":"garimaggupta/temporal-deep-research-demo","owner":"garimaggupta","html_url":"https://github.com/garimaggupta/temporal-deep-research-demo","stars":0,"forks":4,"watchers":0,"issues":6,"language":"Python","description":"This repository builds on the Temporal Interactive Deep Research Demo by @steveandroulakis, adding a Streamlit-based user interface.","topics":[],"score":234949,"global_rank":95447,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":16550}]